   "short": false,
   "hook": "AI hackers hit Korean banks",
   "name_chips": true,
   "lines": [
    {
     "who": "anchor",
     "text": "Welcome to Four Eyes Report. Three stories this week: one about hackers, one about a missile, and one about an alphabet.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep06_001.mp3",
     "shot": "k_screen",
     "cam_id": "screen_anchor",
     "push": false,
     "screen": "three"
    },
    {
     "who": "panel",
     "text": "An alphabet? In the same sentence as a missile? Bold.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep06_002.mp3",
     "shot": "cam",
     "cam": [
      960,
      500,
      1.1
     ],
     "ease": 0.14,
     "cam_id": "two",
     "push": false
    },
    {
     "who": "anchor",
     "text": "It's that kind of week. Let's start with the one making Korean banks nervous. Our tech expert, Bill Dusk.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep06_003.mp3",
     "shot": "cam",
     "cam": [
      960,
      500,
      1.1
     ],
     "ease": 0.14,
     "cam_id": "two",
     "push": false
    },
    {
     "who": "guest",
     "text": "...Hello.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep06_004.mp3",
     "shot": "cam",
     "cam": [
      2560,
      470,
      1.3
     ],
     "ease": 0.12,
     "cam_id": "guest",
     "push": false
    },
    {
     "who": "panel",
     "text": "Kimbot just blinked. That's never good.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep06_005.mp3",
     "shot": "cam",
     "cam": [
      960,
      500,
      1.1
     ],
     "ease": 0.14,
     "cam_id": "two",
     "push": false
    },
    {
     "who": "anchor",
     "text": "Early this month, customer data leaked from banks and lenders in Korea. Seven financial firms have reported breaches so far.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep06_006.mp3",
     "shot": "k_screen",
     "cam_id": "screen_anchor",
     "push": false,
     "screen": "firms7"
    },
    {
     "who": "anchor",
     "text": "Shinhan Bank, KB Kookmin Bank, Hana Bank, BNK Busan Bank, Yegaram Savings Bank, Welcome Savings Bank, and Hyundai Capital.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep06_007.mp3",
     "shot": "k_screen",
     "cam_id": "screen_anchor",
     "push": false,
     "screen": "banks"
    },
    {
     "who": "panel",
     "text": "Seven. Is that a lot?",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep06_008.mp3",
     "shot": "cam",
     "cam": [
      960,
      500,
      1.1
     ],
     "ease": 0.14,
     "cam_id": "two",
     "push": false
    },
    {
     "who": "guest",
     "text": "In one week? Yes.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep06_009.mp3",
     "shot": "cam",
     "cam": [
      2560,
      470,
      1.3
     ],
     "ease": 0.12,
     "cam_id": "guest",
     "push": false
    },
    {
     "who": "anchor",
     "text": "Shinhan Bank says about twenty-five thousand customers had their names, phone numbers, and annual income exposed.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep06_010.mp3",
     "shot": "k_screen",
     "cam_id": "screen_anchor",
     "push": false,
     "screen": "n25000"
    },
    {
     "who": "panel",
     "text": "Annual income. That's the one number I don't even tell my mother.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep06_011.mp3",
     "shot": "cam",
     "cam": [
      960,
      500,
      1.1
     ],
     "ease": 0.14,
     "cam_id": "two",
     "push": false
    },
    {
     "who": "anchor",
     "text": "Hana Bank reported eighty-nine customers. Woori Bank and NH Nonghyup Bank were targeted too, but they blocked the attempts.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep06_012.mp3",
     "shot": "k_screen",
     "cam_id": "screen_anchor",
     "push": false,
     "screen": "hana89"
    },
    {
     "who": "panel",
     "text": "So some of the doors held.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep06_013.mp3",
     "shot": "cam",
     "cam": [
      960,
      500,
      1.1
     ],
     "ease": 0.14,
     "cam_id": "two",
     "push": false
    },
    {
     "who": "anchor",
     "text": "Why are people calling it AI hacking? Bill?",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep06_014.mp3",
     "shot": "cam",
     "cam": [
      960,
      500,
      1.1
     ],
     "ease": 0.14,
     "cam_id": "two",
     "push": false
    },
    {
     "who": "guest",
     "text": "Authorities suspect the attackers used AI tools to scan many companies for weak spots, then went in where the lock was soft.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep06_015.mp3",
     "shot": "k_screen",
     "cam_id": "screen_guest",
     "push": false,
     "screen": "scan"
    },
    {
     "who": "panel",
     "text": "So the burglar has an assistant.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep06_016.mp3",
     "shot": "cam",
     "cam": [
      960,
      500,
      1.1
     ],
     "ease": 0.14,
     "cam_id": "two",
     "push": false
    },
    {
     "who": "guest",
     "text": "A fast one.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep06_017.mp3",
     "shot": "cam",
     "cam": [
      2560,
      470,
      1.3
     ],
     "ease": 0.12,
     "cam_id": "guest",
     "push": false
    },
    {
     "who": "anchor",
     "text": "Reports say the weak spots were in systems used by staff and loan agents, like business support and information lookup services.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep06_018.mp3",
     "shot": "cam",
     "cam": [
      960,
      500,
      1.1
     ],
     "ease": 0.14,
     "cam_id": "two",
     "push": false
    },
    {
     "who": "panel",
     "text": "The side door, not the front door.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep06_019.mp3",
     "shot": "cam",
     "cam": [
      960,
      500,
      1.1
     ],
     "ease": 0.14,
     "cam_id": "two",
     "push": false
    },
    {
     "who": "anchor",
     "text": "And it happened during the long October holiday, when offices are quiet.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep06_020.mp3",
     "shot": "cam",
     "cam": [
      960,
      500,
      1.1
     ],
     "ease": 0.14,
     "cam_id": "two",
     "push": false
    },
    {
     "who": "panel",
     "text": "Hackers love a long weekend too.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep06_021.mp3",
     "shot": "cam",
     "cam": [
      960,
      500,
      1.1
     ],
     "ease": 0.14,
     "cam_id": "two",
     "push": false
    },
    {
     "who": "anchor",
     "text": "The Financial Supervisory Service traced around thirty IP addresses in a dozen countries. But officials say an IP location doesn't prove who is really behind it.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep06_022.mp3",
     "shot": "k_screen",
     "cam_id": "screen_anchor",
     "push": false,
     "screen": "ips"
    },
    {
     "who": "panel",
     "text": "So nobody knows who it is yet.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep06_023.mp3",
     "shot": "cam",
     "cam": [
      960,
      500,
      1.1
     ],
     "ease": 0.14,
     "cam_id": "two",
     "push": false
    },
    {
     "who": "anchor",
     "text": "Right. The attackers' identity is still unknown.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep06_024.mp3",
     "shot": "cam",
     "cam": [
      960,
      500,
      1.1
     ],
     "ease": 0.14,
     "cam_id": "two",
     "push": false
    },
    {
     "who": "anchor",
     "text": "On October sixth, regulators issued a caution-level alert and started a month-long special response period. President Lee Jae Myung called for a thorough investigation.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep06_025.mp3",
     "shot": "k_screen",
     "cam_id": "screen_anchor",
     "push": false,
     "screen": "alert"
    },
    {
     "who": "anchor",
     "text": "Officials say passwords were not leaked, and no financial losses have been confirmed so far.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep06_026.mp3",
     "shot": "k_screen",
     "cam_id": "screen_anchor",
     "push": false,
     "screen": "alert"
    },
    {
     "who": "panel",
     "text": "Okay. So what do I do?",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep06_027.mp3",
     "shot": "cam",
     "cam": [
      960,
      500,
      1.1
     ],
     "ease": 0.14,
     "cam_id": "two",
     "push": false
    },
    {
     "who": "guest",
     "text": "First: if a caller knows your income, that does not make the call real. Scammers can use leaked details to sound convincing.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep06_028.mp3",
     "shot": "k_screen",
     "cam_id": "screen_guest",
     "push": false,
     "screen": "income"
    },
    {
     "who": "guest",
     "text": "Second: check through your bank's official website or main phone number. Not through the caller or a text message.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep06_029.mp3",
     "shot": "cam",
     "cam": [
      2560,
      470,
      1.3
     ],
     "ease": 0.12,
     "cam_id": "guest",
     "push": false
    },
    {
     "who": "guest",
     "text": "Third: don't keep ID numbers, account passwords, or ID copies on your phone.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep06_030.mp3",
     "shot": "cam",
     "cam": [
      2560,
      470,
      1.3
     ],
     "ease": 0.12,
     "cam_id": "guest",
     "push": false
    },
    {
     "who": "panel",
     "text": "Wait. Coupang went down too, didn't it? Is that connected?",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep06_031.mp3",
     "shot": "cam",
     "cam": [
      960,
      500,
      1.1
     ],
     "ease": 0.14,
     "cam_id": "two",
     "push": false
    },
    {
     "who": "anchor",
     "text": "On October ninth, around one a.m., Coupang's app and delivery services were down for about two hours. The cause is not confirmed, and no report links it to the bank breaches.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep06_032.mp3",
     "shot": "k_screen",
     "cam_id": "screen_anchor",
     "push": false,
     "screen": "coupang"
    },
    {
     "who": "guest",
     "text": "Not every outage is an attack.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep06_033.mp3",
     "shot": "cam",
     "cam": [
      2560,
      470,
      1.3
     ],
     "ease": 0.12,
     "cam_id": "guest",
     "push": false
    },
    {
     "who": "panel",
     "text": "Kimbot disagrees. Kimbot thinks everything is an attack.",
     "audio": "audio/v1/ep06_034.mp3",
     "shot": "cam",
     "cam": [
      960,
      500,
      1.1
     ],
     "ease": 0.14,
     "cam_id": "two",
     "push": false
    }
   ]
  },
